    "Time away counts toward a fresh start. Stay off an app for its break length.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Time away counts toward a fresh start. Stay off an app for its break length."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主动歇够这个 App 的休息时长，用时就重新算。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主動休息滿這個 App 的休息時間，就重新計時。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si dejas la app el tiempo que dura su pausa, el contador vuelve a cero."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quitte l’app le temps de sa pause et son compteur repart à zéro."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bleib für die eingestellte Pausendauer aus der App. Dann zählt sie wieder ab null."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lascia l’app per la durata della sua pausa e il timer riparte da zero."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "設定した休憩時間だけアプリを離れると、計測は初めから。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "앱에서 설정한 휴식 시간만큼 쉬면 처음부터 다시 계산해요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fique fora do app pelo tempo da pausa e o contador começa do zero."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each app counts separately. Short visits add up. A gap in usage as long as the app’s break resets its timer. Usage also resets after a break or at midnight. Blocks include messages.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each app counts separately. Short visits add up. A gap in usage as long as the app’s break resets its timer. Usage also resets after a break or at midnight. Blocks include messages."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个 App 单独计时。短暂离开会接着算；两段用量之间歇够设定时长，就重新计时。强制休息结束或午夜也会清零。拦截包括私信。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每個 App 分開計時。短暫離開會繼續累計，使用紀錄間的空檔達到休息時間，就重新計時。休息結束或午夜也會歸零。封鎖包含私訊。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada app cuenta por separado. Las visitas seguidas se suman. Si el tiempo sin uso alcanza la duración de la pausa, el contador vuelve a cero. También se reinicia tras cada pausa o a medianoche. Los mensajes también se bloquean."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque app a son compteur. Les visites rapprochées s’additionnent. Si le temps passé ailleurs atteint la durée de pause, le compteur repart à zéro. Il se réinitialise aussi après une pause ou à minuit. Les messages sont également bloqués."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jede App zählt einzeln. Kurze Besuche addieren sich. Bleibt die App eine Pausenlänge lang ungenutzt, beginnt der Zähler neu. Auch nach einer Pause und um Mitternacht startet er neu. Nachrichten sind mitgesperrt."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ogni app ha il suo timer. Le visite ravvicinate si sommano. Dopo un intervallo senza uso pari alla pausa, il timer si azzera. Si azzera anche dopo una pausa o a mezzanotte. Il blocco include i messaggi."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アプリごとに計測します。短い中断は合算しますが、使用記録の間隔が休憩時間に達するとリセットします。休憩終了時と午前0時にもリセットします。休憩中はメッセージも使えません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "앱마다 따로 계산해요. 짧은 사용은 합산하지만, 사용 기록 사이에 설정한 휴식 시간만큼 쉬면 초기화돼요. 휴식이 끝나거나 자정이 돼도 초기화돼요. 메시지도 차단돼요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada app tem seu contador. Visitas próximas se somam. Quando o intervalo sem uso dura o tempo da pausa, o contador zera. Ele também zera após a pausa ou à meia-noite. O bloqueio inclui mensagens."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At %1$d min total, this app locks for %2$d min. Stay away for %2$d min to start fresh.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At %1$d min total, this app locks for %2$d min. Stay away for %2$d min to start fresh."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "累计用满 %1$d 分钟，锁 %2$d 分钟。提前离开满 %2$d 分钟，用时清零。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "累計用滿 %1$d 分鐘，鎖定 %2$d 分鐘。提早離開滿 %2$d 分鐘，用時歸零。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Après %1$d min cumulées, cette app se bloque pendant %2$d min. Quitte-la %2$d min pour repartir à zéro."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nach insgesamt %1$d Min. wird die App für %2$d Min. gesperrt. Bleibst du %2$d Min. weg, zählt sie wieder ab null."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dopo %1$d min di utilizzo totale, l’app si blocca per %2$d min. Se la lasci per %2$d min, il timer si azzera."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tras %1$d min de uso total, la app se bloquea durante %2$d min. Si la dejas %2$d min, el contador vuelve a cero."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Com %1$d min de uso no total, o app bloqueia por %2$d min. Se você sair por %2$d min, o contador zera."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "合計%1$d分使うと、このアプリを%2$d分間ブロック。先に%2$d分離れても、使用時間はゼロに戻ります。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "총 %1$d분 쓰면 이 앱이 %2$d분 동안 잠겨요. 먼저 앱을 나가 %2$d분 쉬어도 사용 시간이 초기화돼요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
